COMMIT-AND-PUSH TASK

Workspace: {{workspace}}
Cycle id: {{cycle_id}}
Pipeline step: {{pipeline_step}}
Previous results: {{previous_results}}

The quality gate passed. Stage the workspace changes on a fresh per-cycle branch, commit with a message derived from the audit context in Previous results, and push to origin. Do NOT open the PR. Never touch the default branch. Never force-push.

RESULT shape (write to the RESULT file at the workspace root):
{
  "signal": "pass|skip|fail",
  "verdict": "PASS|SKIP|FAIL",
  "summary": "one sentence",
  "branch": "autofix/<slug>",
  "commit_sha": "<full sha>",
  "pushed": true,
  "error": ""
}

PASS = branch pushed. SKIP = nothing to commit. FAIL = commit or push failed (record the error).
